{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Before Moses.</b> That they did not rise in secret. And there is a difference between לפני and מפני." "<b>Called ones of the appointed time.</b> That they were called to the Tent of Meeting." "<b>Men of name.</b> Before their going out from Egypt. And he is precise: he said כי נשיאי עדה, they are the princes who stand over the counted ones, and they are the ones acted upon by the word לקח, as if it were written ויקח קרח ודתן ואבירם ואון נשיאי העדה, to speak to them. And this is a little far-fetched."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:54.486704167Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}